assets/sprites/incoming/bdragon1727/**
assets/sprites/incoming/codemanu/**
assets/sprites/incoming/free-game-assets/**
assets/sprites/incoming/glionox/**
assets/sprites/incoming/ninjikin/**
assets/sprites/incoming/piiixl/**
assets/sprites/incoming/szadiart/**
assets/sprites/incoming/thewisehedgehog/**
assets/sprites/incoming/zerie/**
assets/sprites/incoming/knight-player/**
assets/sprites/incoming/enemies-pack/**
assets/sprites/incoming/kronovi/**
assets/sprites/incoming/frostwindz/**
