assets/sprites/incoming/wenrexa/**
# a tira recortada do portal da Frostwindz (pack PAGO): ja' nao se gera --
# o portal passou a sair do pack de dominio publico do CodeManu
# (`props/portal.png`, esse sim comitado). A regra fica aqui de guarda,
# para nao voltar a escapar. Ver incoming/LICENSES.md.
assets/sprites/pixel/props/portal_fim.png*
# packs que o AGENTE descarregou (OpenGameArt, CC0) -- ver incoming/LICENSES.md
assets/sprites/incoming/_dl/**
!assets/sprites/incoming/gothicvania/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/luizmelo/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/clembod/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/chierit/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/0x72-dungeon-ii/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/ansimuz-parallax/_LARGAR_AQUI.md
!assets/sprites/incoming/kronovi/LICENSE.txt
tools/_bot.gd
tools/_bot.tscn
tools/_bot.gd.uid

# fontes de musica em bruto que o AGENTE descarregou (OpenGameArt) --
# dezenas de MB; so se comitam as camas ja cortadas em assets/audio/musica/.
# Reconstroi-se com `python tools/preparar_musica.py --descarregar`.
assets/audio/incoming/**
